       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRINGPTRDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NAME  PIC X(10) VALUE "ADA".
       01 LAST-NAME   PIC X(10) VALUE "LOVELACE".
       01 TITLE-TXT   PIC X(5) VALUE "MS".
       01 FULL-NAME   PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
       01 PTR         PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       01 OVERFLOW-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
       01 SMALL-BUF   PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           STRING TITLE-TXT DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  ". "      DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  " "       DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  LAST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO FULL-NAME WITH POINTER PTR
           END-STRING
           DISPLAY "RESULT:  " FULL-NAME
           DISPLAY "POINTER: " PTR

           MOVE 1 TO PTR
           STRING "ABCDEFGHIJKL" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO SMALL-BUF WITH POINTER PTR
               ON OVERFLOW MOVE "Y" TO OVERFLOW-FLAG
           END-STRING
           DISPLAY "TRUNCATED: " SMALL-BUF
           DISPLAY "OVERFLOW:  " OVERFLOW-FLAG
           STOP RUN.
